unknown relationship 'NON ADDITIVE BY' in USING clause

# --- lexer: quoted identifiers, strings, dollar quotes, escape strings (lexer.rs, cursor.rs) ---

# C-175: body_parser/lexer.rs::keyword_inside_quoted_ident_is_one_token,
#   body_parser/lexer.rs::string_literal_with_escape_and_keywords,
#   body_parser/lexer.rs::well_formed_over_hostile_inputs,
#   body_parser/cursor.rs::find_kw_skips_quoted_and_strings,
#   body_parser/cursor.rs::take_parens_is_quote_and_nest_aware
#   — keywords and `)` inside quoted identifiers and strings are inert: table "dcc PRIMARY KEY (id)", PK ("x)y"), UNIQUE ("UNIQUE"), COMMENT with UNIQUE and a doubled quote [text]
# PRE-EXISTING (TECH-DEBT #96): DESCRIBE's BASE_TABLE_NAME (and the TABLE object_name) keep the
# identifier's double quotes; Snowflake reports the bare name.
